# Generated PowerPoint binaries — regenerate from .md via:
#   npx --yes @marp-team/marp-cli@4.4.0 --pptx -o <name>.pptx <name>.md
#
# Pinned to a specific marp-cli version (not @latest) so future
# regenerations produce deterministic output. Bump the version
# intentionally when you want to pull in upstream improvements.
*.pptx
*.pdf
